  "description": "Ground AI answers in application-managed documents with loading, splitting, embeddings, vector/text/hybrid retrieval, reranking and metadata filters. Request-based retrievers support keyword-only queries and configurable weighted RRF while retaining legacy strategies. Provides standard and Agentic RAG, streaming runs, cancellation, provider processing-speed forwarding and optional PIXIE store integration. Validates indexing and embedding output, replaces document-scoped records, and isolates query rewriting and reranking. Includes Perplexity standard/contextualized embeddings and explicit binary vectors. Depends on Mythosia.AI.Abstractions and Mythosia.AI.Rag.Abstractions without referencing the full Mythosia.AI implementation. What's New in v8.1.1: Existing RAG wrappers honor runtime query rewriter additions, replacement and clearing while preserving in-flight requests and one-time automatic initialization.",
