  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.1.1: Fixes stale query rewriter selection in existing RagEnabledService wrappers. Each request captures the store's current rewriter once, so additions, replacement and clearing affect later requests while in-flight requests retain their selected instance. Lazy stores are published only after automatic rewriter initialization; an explicit clear does not recreate it. No public API changes, reindexing or migration required when upgrading from 8.1.0. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v811",
